---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import AdvertiserDisclosure from '../../components/AdvertiserDisclosure.astro';
---
<Base
  title="Sauna Reviews: Brands, Heaters, and Home Saunas (2026)"
  description="Research-backed sauna reviews organized by brand, heater, and product type, with clear evidence limits and practical checks for homeowners."
  canonical="/reviews"
>
  <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
    <header class="mb-8">
      <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-amber-700 mb-3">Independent buyer research</p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-stone-900 mb-3">Sauna Reviews for Real Buying Decisions</h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-stone-600 mb-3">Start with the kind of sauna you are buying. Then compare the details that change the project: room size, heater, electrical requirements, delivery, warranty, and installed cost.</p>
      <p class="text-sm text-stone-500">Reviewed August 2026 &middot; Backyard Sauna Pro</p>
    </header>

    <AdvertiserDisclosure />

    <div class="mb-6 bg-stone-900 text-amber-50 rounded-xl p-5">
      <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-amber-200 mb-2">Featured for 2026</p>
      <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed">Our 2026 Best Overall pick is the <a href="/guides/best-home-sauna/" class="text-amber-200 underline hover:text-white font-semibold">Sun Home Equinox</a> (premium full-spectrum infrared). See the full <a href="/best-saunas/" class="text-amber-200 underline hover:text-white font-semibold">2026 top picks list</a> for premium, traditional, budget, red light, and outdoor options.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200 rounded-xl p-5 mb-10 text-sm text-stone-700">
      <strong>What "review" means here:</strong> Unless a page documents firsthand access, it is a desk-researched buyer analysis. We check current manufacturer specifications, manuals, warranty terms, retailer details, and attributable owner feedback. We do not claim hands-on testing that did not happen. <a href="/how-we-review/" class="text-amber-800 underline font-semibold">Read the full methodology.</a>
    </div>

    <section class="mb-12">
      <div class="flex items-end justify-between gap-4 mb-5">
        <div>
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-amber-700 mb-2">Outdoor sauna brands</p>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900">Compare the company before the model</h2>
        </div>
        <a href="/brands/" class="hidden sm:inline text-sm font-semibold text-amber-800 hover:underline">See all brand reviews</a>
      </div>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
        <a href="/brands/redwood-outdoors-sauna-review/" class="block bg-white border border-stone-200 rounded-lg p-5 hover:border-amber-400 transition-colors">
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-amber-700 uppercase mb-2">Current lineup check</p>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-stone-900 mb-2">Redwood Outdoors</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-stone-600">Heat-treated hemlock, barrel and cabin formats, freight delivery, and a one-year limited sauna warranty.</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/brands/almost-heaven-sauna-review/" class="block bg-white border border-stone-200 rounded-lg p-5 hover:border-amber-400 transition-colors">
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-amber-700 uppercase mb-2">Traditional sauna kits</p>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-stone-900 mb-2">Almost Heaven</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-stone-600">A model-by-model look at barrel and cabin kits, heater choices, warranty questions, and buyer fit.</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/brands/dundalk-leisurecraft-review/" class="block bg-white border border-stone-200 rounded-lg p-5 hover:border-amber-400 transition-colors">
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-amber-700 uppercase mb-2">Canadian-made options</p>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-stone-900 mb-2">Dundalk LeisureCraft</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-stone-600">A practical review of product formats, materials, site planning, and questions to ask a dealer.</p>
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-12">
      <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-amber-700 mb-2">Sauna heaters</p>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 mb-5">Choose a heater as a complete system</h2>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
        <a href="/reviews/harvia-kip-60b-review/" class="block bg-white border border-stone-200 rounded-lg p-5 hover:border-amber-400 transition-colors">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-stone-900 mb-2">Harvia KIP 60B</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-stone-600">Published specifications, room-sizing questions, electrical planning, controls, and limitations.</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/brands/huum-sauna-heater-review/" class="block bg-white border border-stone-200 rounded-lg p-5 hover:border-amber-400 transition-colors">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-stone-900 mb-2">HUUM DROP vs HIVE</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-stone-600">A verification-first comparison of room fit, rock load, controls, clearances, and installed cost.</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/brands/harvia-sauna-heater-review/" class="block bg-white border border-stone-200 rounded-lg p-5 hover:border-amber-400 transition-colors">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-stone-900 mb-2">Harvia heater range</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-stone-600">KIP, M3, Cilindro, and other heater families organized by the project questions that matter.</p>
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-12">
      <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-amber-700 mb-2">Indoor and infrared</p>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 mb-5">Check the experience, power, and room fit</h2>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
        <a href="/reviews/dynamic-saunas-barcelona-review/" class="block bg-white border border-stone-200 rounded-lg p-5 hover:border-amber-400 transition-colors">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-stone-900 mb-2">Dynamic Barcelona</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-stone-600">A compact infrared model reviewed through published specifications, setup needs, and buyer limitations.</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/brands/dynamic-saunas-review/" class="block bg-white border border-stone-200 rounded-lg p-5 hover:border-amber-400 transition-colors">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-stone-900 mb-2">Dynamic Saunas</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-stone-600">Compare plug-in infrared models before choosing on price or marketplace ratings alone.</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/brands/finnleo-sauna-review/" class="block bg-white border border-stone-200 rounded-lg p-5 hover:border-amber-400 transition-colors">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-stone-900 mb-2">Finnleo</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-stone-600">A premium indoor sauna overview with product, dealer, installation, and budget questions.</p>
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="bg-emerald-50 border border-emerald-200 rounded-xl p-6">
      <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-emerald-800 mb-2">Before you request quotes</p>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 mb-3">Turn the shortlist into a project brief</h2>
      <p class="text-stone-700 mb-5">A good product can still be wrong for the site. Record your dimensions, budget, delivery access, heater preference, electrical questions, and installation needs before asking a retailer or contractor to price the work.</p>
      <a href="/sauna-planner/?ref=reviews_hub&campaign=planner_first_10&placement=reviews_hub_bottom" class="inline-block bg-emerald-800 hover:bg-emerald-900 text-white font-semibold px-5 py-3 rounded-lg" data-track-event="planner_cta_clicked" data-cta-position="reviews_hub_bottom">Build a sauna project brief</a>
      <p class="text-xs text-stone-600 mt-3">The planner is an educational aid, not engineering, electrical, permit, or safety approval.</p>
    </section>
  </article>
</Base>
